<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 3.758 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 3.758 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said the average yield at this week's auction of C$3.2 billion of 91-day Government of Canada treasury bills due December 19 was 3.758 percent, down from 3.958 percent last week.</p>
<p>The average yield on C$1.6 billion of 175-day T-bills due March 13, 1997 was 4.265 percent, down from 4.353 percent last week, and on C$1.3 billion of 364-day T-bills due September 18, 1997 was 4.682 percent, down from 4.853 percent.</p>
<p>The Bank bought C$900 million three-month, C$150 million six-month and C$100 million one-year bills. It holds C$1.15 billion of C$4.9 billion of bills due Sept 26.</p>
